"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1295900","steamName":"Draconia","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1295900/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:57:37.319777+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Create your dragon, customize it, level it. Explore the world of Draconia and unravel its story. Draconia is an MORPG where YOU play as the dragon!","detailedDescription":"Become the Dragon\n\nStep into the scales of a mighty dragon and claim the skies, land, or sea as your own.\nChoose from a variety of species, each with its own perks and specializations.\n\nCustomize Your Dragon\n\nMake your character stand out by giving it a unique name, custom colors, and even custom body parts such as horns, tail tips, and claws.\nChoose from a growing list of customization options to create your perfect dragon.\n\nSurvival of the Fittest\n\nHunt for sustenance and locate vital water sources to survive while amassing a hoard of valuable resources through the gathering and inventory system.\nUtilize your treasure trove to craft useful items that improve your dragon's chances of survival and  abilities.\n\nYour World, Your Rules\n\nDraconia respects your playstyle. Grow your dragon by completing quests or battling enemies.\nExplore the world in PvE or opt into optional PvP, enabling or disabling it at will through your character profile.\nSafely explore the world of Draconia without fear of unwanted confrontation, and engage in battles only when you choose.\n\nEmbark on the Ultimate Adventure\n\nUnravel the story of Draconia in single-player or multiplayer.\nForm groups and clans, and invite friends and like-minded players to accompany you on your journey.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"ro